IF YOU DO NOT HAVE ACCESS TO TOOLS, IGNORE THIS FILE.

----------

This is a TypeScript monorepo that uses PNPM and Turborepo. The packages are available in "packages/".

If you change code in "packages/", run the following commands (in this order) at the level of the modified package:
- `pnpm lint:fix`
- `pnpm build`

If any of the commands fail, fix the code.
